- retain per-metric sample counts in task results
- use each metric/filter's own count for size-weighted group scores and pooled uncertainty
- fall back to task-level sample length for older or manually constructed results
- add task-count and group-weighting regression coverage
- apply behavior-neutral lint cleanup required in the touched aggregation modules

Fixes #4322

