Issue #220: feat: add sayf-eval results-record converter
Body: ## What

Adds a converter for **[sayf-eval](https://pypi.org/project/sayf-eval/)** — a model-agnostic cybersecurity LLM-evaluation framework — so its results can be ingested into the Every Eval Ever schema:

```bash
every_eval_ever convert sayf_eval --log_path <sayf-eval output dir> --output_dir data
```

